@startuml Context_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

title Attendeely System - Context Diagram

' External Actors
actor "Admin/Manager" as Admin
actor "Employee" as Employee
actor "Super Admin" as SuperAdmin

' System Boundary
package "Attendeely Backend API" {
    component [FastAPI Application] as API {
        component [API Endpoints] as Endpoints
        component [Business Logic] as Logic
        component [Authentication] as Auth
    }
}

' External Systems
database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as DB
cloud "Fapshi\nPayment Gateway" as Fapshi
cloud "Cloudinary\nImage Storage" as Cloudinary
cloud "Resend\nEmail Service" as Resend
rectangle "Frontend\nApplication" as Frontend

' Relationships - Admin
Admin --> Endpoints : HTTP Requests\n(Signup, Login, Manage Org)
Admin --> Endpoints : Manage Employees
Admin --> Endpoints : Process Payroll
Admin --> Endpoints : Manage Subscriptions
Admin --> Endpoints : View Dashboard

' Relationships - Employee
Employee --> Endpoints : HTTP Requests\n(Login, Check-in/out)
Employee --> Endpoints : Submit Leave Requests
Employee --> Endpoints : View Profile

' Relationships - Super Admin
SuperAdmin --> Endpoints : System-wide\nManagement

' Relationships - Frontend
Frontend --> Endpoints : HTTP/REST API\nJSON Requests
Endpoints --> Frontend : JSON Responses

' Relationships - Database
Endpoints --> DB : SQL Queries\n(CRUD Operations)
DB --> Endpoints : Query Results

' Relationships - External Services
Logic --> Fapshi : Payment Initiation\n(amount, phone, email)
Fapshi --> Endpoints : Payment Webhooks\n(transId, status)
Logic --> Cloudinary : Image Upload\n(logo, photos)
Cloudinary --> Logic : Image URLs
Logic --> Resend : Send Emails\n(OTP, notifications)
Resend --> Logic : Email Confirmations

' Authentication Flow
Auth --> DB : Verify Credentials
Auth --> Endpoints : JWT Tokens

note right of API
  **System Components:**
  - Authentication & Authorization
  - Organization Management
  - Employee Management
  - Attendance Tracking
  - Leave Request Management
  - Payroll Processing
  - Subscription Management
  - Dashboard & Analytics
  - Notification System
end note

note bottom of Fapshi
  **Payment Integration:**
  - Direct Pay API
  - Webhook Callbacks
  - Transaction Status Updates
end note

note bottom of Cloudinary
  **Image Management:**
  - Organization Logos
  - Employee Photos
  - CDN Delivery
end note

note bottom of Resend
  **Email Services:**
  - OTP Verification
  - Password Resets
  - Leave Notifications
end note

@enduml
